sequenceDiagram
autonumber
actor System as System
participant PredictionAPIs as Boundary: PredictionAPIs
participant DualInferenceControl as Control: DualInferenceControl
participant ModelResult as Entity: ModelResult
System->>PredictionAPIs: Receive task-specific request
PredictionAPIs->>DualInferenceControl: Select and validate pipeline
DualInferenceControl->>ModelResult: Load active model and cache identity
ModelResult-->>DualInferenceControl: Return validated model contract
DualInferenceControl-->>PredictionAPIs: Persist task-specific evidence
PredictionAPIs-->>System: Return count or screening response
